{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro Delivery</strong> is a fast 2D platformer where every second and every jump count. Grab the package and deliver it in the shortest time possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER SPEED &amp; PRECISION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is designed around crisp, responsive controls. You\u2019ll need sharp reflexes and clean execution to overcome timed traps, moving platforms and deadly hazards. Tight movement means you are always in control when shaving off milliseconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/ce4848554bcf145ce0fc072f1f9a312e.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/ce4848554bcf145ce0fc072f1f9a312e.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/ce4848554bcf145ce0fc072f1f9a312e.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDDEN ROUTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more than one way to deliver a package. Each level has a hideen route and clever shortcuts that reward creative path\u2011finding. The smartest route isn\u2019t always obvious, so exploring every corner can make the difference between a bronze and a gold medal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/684c516f07b4a3c9c8509812375f3dbb.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/684c516f07b4a3c9c8509812375f3dbb.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/684c516f07b4a3c9c8509812375f3dbb.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHASE THE PERFECT RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our star\u2011rating system pushes you to improve. Beat the level and you\u2019ll earn a rating based on your time. Replay levels to refine your route, tighten your execution and climb the leaderboards. Every death teaches you something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/f096543463fe25a77363a9a588ce9c28.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/f096543463fe25a77363a9a588ce9c28.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/f096543463fe25a77363a9a588ce9c28.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPACT PUZZLES &amp; TIMED TRAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed isn\u2019t everything. Many stages add light puzzles to break the rush. Simple switches, moving platforms, and timed traps that test your rhythm without slowing you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/d6d7cb248e9be90511ab7a83d6a5c553.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/d6d7cb248e9be90511ab7a83d6a5c553.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/d6d7cb248e9be90511ab7a83d6a5c553.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PLACE FOR SPEEDRUNNERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to precision platformers or a seasoned speedrunner, <i>Astro Delivery</i> offers depth. It\u2019s easy to pick up but difficult to master, and its fast respawns encourage experimentation. Can you deliver every package in perfect time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/4d9f37d0d469a5b649910d4f17382349.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/4d9f37d0d469a5b649910d4f17382349.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/4d9f37d0d469a5b649910d4f17382349.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927530?t=1756941041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927530?t=1756941041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/b9051b10a1914e283de7fc684cc49c8f1dfb7530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756941041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/b9051b10a1914e283de7fc684cc49c8f1dfb7530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756941041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro Delivery</strong> is a fast 2D platformer where every second and every jump count. Grab the package and deliver it in the shortest time possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER SPEED &amp; PRECISION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is designed around crisp, responsive controls. You\u2019ll need sharp reflexes and clean execution to overcome timed traps, moving platforms and deadly hazards. Tight movement means you are always in control when shaving off milliseconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/ce4848554bcf145ce0fc072f1f9a312e.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/ce4848554bcf145ce0fc072f1f9a312e.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/ce4848554bcf145ce0fc072f1f9a312e.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDDEN ROUTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more than one way to deliver a package. Each level has a hideen route and clever shortcuts that reward creative path\u2011finding. The smartest route isn\u2019t always obvious, so exploring every corner can make the difference between a bronze and a gold medal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/684c516f07b4a3c9c8509812375f3dbb.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/684c516f07b4a3c9c8509812375f3dbb.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/684c516f07b4a3c9c8509812375f3dbb.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHASE THE PERFECT RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our star\u2011rating system pushes you to improve. Beat the level and you\u2019ll earn a rating based on your time. Replay levels to refine your route, tighten your execution and climb the leaderboards. Every death teaches you something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/f096543463fe25a77363a9a588ce9c28.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/f096543463fe25a77363a9a588ce9c28.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/f096543463fe25a77363a9a588ce9c28.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPACT PUZZLES &amp; TIMED TRAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed isn\u2019t everything. Many stages add light puzzles to break the rush. Simple switches, moving platforms, and timed traps that test your rhythm without slowing you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/d6d7cb248e9be90511ab7a83d6a5c553.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/d6d7cb248e9be90511ab7a83d6a5c553.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/d6d7cb248e9be90511ab7a83d6a5c553.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PLACE FOR SPEEDRUNNERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to precision platformers or a seasoned speedrunner, <i>Astro Delivery</i> offers depth. It\u2019s easy to pick up but difficult to master, and its fast respawns encourage experimentation. Can you deliver every package in perfect time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/4d9f37d0d469a5b649910d4f17382349.poster.avif?t=1756941041\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/4d9f37d0d469a5b649910d4f17382349.webm?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/extras/4d9f37d0d469a5b649910d4f17382349.mp4?t=1756941041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Knvi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927530/bf92e25ed199083297dc3e8048356e91706b24f5/header.jpg?t=1756941041","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190844,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190844/movie480.mp4?t=1756490527","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190844/movie_max.mp4?t=1756490527"},"name":"Astro Delivery Trailer","thumbnail":